="01:39.555" end="01:40.434">get </span><span begin="01:40.434" end="01:40.713">too </span><span begin="01:40.713" end="01:41.038">near</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.033" end="01:43.544"><span begin="01:41.033" end="01:41.635">I </span><span begin="01:41.635" end="01:41.977">might </span><span begin="01:41.977" end="01:43.540">disappear</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.513" end="01:46.108"><span begin="01:43.513" end="01:44.107">I </span><span begin="01:44.107" end="01:44.417">might </span><span begin="01:44.417" end="01:45.071">lose </span><span begin="01:45.071" end="01:45.342">my </span><span begin="01:45.342" end="01:46.107">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.262" end="01:47.448"><span begin="01:46.262" end="01:47.443">Chorus</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.354" end="01:52.246"><span begin="01:48.354" end="01:49.061">Baby </span><span begin="01:49.061" end="01:49.458">I'm </span><span begin="01:49.458" end="01:50.313">too </span><span begin="01:50.313" end="01:51.179">lost </span><span begin="01:51.179" end="01:51.709">in </span><span begin="01:51.709" end="01:52.245">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.469" end="01:55.108"><span begin="01:52.469" end="01:53.599">Caught </span><span begin="01:53.599" end="01:54.181">in </span><span begin="01:54.181" end="01:55.104">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.182" end="01:58.850"><span begin="01:55.182" end="01:56.080">Lost </span><span begin="01:56.080" end="01:56.670">in </span><span begin="01:56.670" end="01:57.892">everything </span><span begin="01:57.892" end="01:58.186">about </span><span begin="01:58.186" end="01:58.841">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.755" end="02:02.222"><span begin="01:58.755" end="01:59.236">So </span><span begin="01:59.236" end="02:00.330">deep </span><span begin="02:00.330" end="02:00.930">I </span><span begin="02:00.930" end="02:01.566">can't </span><span begin="02:01.566" end="02:02.221">sleep</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1"